<title>HONG KONG: HK weather - sunny, max 29 degrees C.</title>
<headline>HK weather - sunny, max 29 degrees C.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>It will be sunny with maximum temperature reaching 29 degrees, the Royal Observatory said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>At 7 a.m., the temperature was 25 C and the relative humidity 88 per cent, the observatory said.</p>
<p>Showers are expected on Thursday and Friday, it said.</p>
<p>-- HONG KONG NEWSROOM (852) 2843-6441</p>
